:27Z","email":"agent@test.local","name":"Test Agent"},"message":"refactor: Modernize link plugin architecture with plugin-dev-sdk\n\nThis commit modernizes the link plugin by integrating the new plugin-dev-sdk for streamlined development:\n\n- **Plugin-Dev-SDK Integration**: Replace custom dev environment with standardized SDK\n- **Simplified Architecture**: Remove dual-server setup, use single development flow\n- **File Restructuring**: Move components to organized `views/` structure\n- **Enhanced Documentation**: Complete README overhaul with deployment info\n- **GitHub Pages Deployment**: Add live demo at https://toplocs.github.io/link-plugin/\n\n- Remove `dev/` directory and custom dev components\n- Add `index.ts` as main development entry point\n- Update component exports to use new slot naming conventions\n- Integrate `@toplocs/plugin-dev-sdk` for development environment\n- Simplify build process and federation setup\n- Update TypeScript configuration for better module resolution\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f5c387413e552b6a9798d1fd2565d79dfbcfb9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toplocs/link-plugin/git/trees/2f5c387413e552b6a9798d1fd2565d79dfbcfb9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toplocs/link-plugin/git/commits/d68fb11ef949891b48494e96feddd7446eaeeda2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/toplocs/link-plugin/commit/d68fb11ef949891b48494e96feddd7446eaeeda2","node_id":"C_kwDOOwyNeNoAKGQ2OGZiMTFlZjk0OTg5MWI0ODQ5NGU5NmZlZGRkNzQ0NmVhZWVkYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/toplocs/link-plugin/commit/dd28851261d6758a366e3c4f441afdc600e9fc69","sha":"dd28851261d6758a366e3c4f441afdc600e9fc69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toplocs/link-plugin/commits/dd28851261d6758a366e3c4f441afdc600e9fc69"}],"sha":"d68fb11ef949891b48494e96feddd7446