 usar el servidor correcto para i18n\n- Actualizado GetLanguageHandler para usar I18N_BASE_URL en lugar de\n  document.location.origin\n- Mejorado middleware CORS en vite.config.ts para permitir headers adicionales\n  (Expires, If-Modified-Since, Last-Modified, ETag) requeridos por\n  @npm_leadtech/jsr-lib-http\n- Añadidos logs de depuración en SetupTranslations.js y Controller.tsx\n- SetLanguage ahora se ejecuta incluso si HandleVisitorUseCase falla,\n  asegurando que las traducciones se carguen siempre\n- Actualizado CHANGELOG.md con la solución completa\n\nResuelve: Las traducciones ahora se cargan correctamente cuando login se\nejecuta dentro del shell en desarrollo","tree":{"sha":"552b85cdf6a5699fc9693e0b2055920ffca9b63e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amallen22/module-federation-hybrid/git/trees/552b85cdf6a5699fc9693e0b2055920ffca9b63e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amallen22/module-federation-hybrid/git/commits/f0f9cbcb0aba583a7a703048bff818654f1bc5cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28595354?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amallen22","id":28595354,"login":"amallen22","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTk1MzU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amallen22/module-federation-hybrid/commit/f0f9cbcb0aba583a7a703048bff818654f1bc5cc","node_id":"C_kwDOOxS0aNoAKGYwZjljYmNiMGFiYTU4M2E3YTcwMzA0OGJmZjgxODY1NGYxYmM1Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amallen22/module-federation-hybrid/commit/676fda6181f0d0bda615f0a51786396af3820dce","sha":"676fda6181f0d0bda615f0a51786396af3820dce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amallen22/module-federation-hybrid/commits/676fda6181f0d0bda615f0a51786396af3820dce"}],"sha":"f0f9cbcb0aba583a7a703048bff818654f1bc5cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amallen22/module-federation-hybrid/commits/f0f9cbcb0aba583a7a703048bff818654f1bc5cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28595354?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amallen22","id":28595354,"login":"amallen22","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTk1MzU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amallen22","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amallen22/module-federation-hybrid/commits/676fda6181f0d0bda615f0a51786396af3820dce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-04T16:58:28Z","email":"alex.mallengines@gmail.com","name":"amallen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-04T16:58:28Z","email":"alex.mallengines@gmail.com","name":"amallen"},"message":"feat(login): migrate from Webpack to Vite + Module Federation\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: apps/login now requires Vite instead of Webpack\n\n## Summary\nComplete migration of apps/login from legacy Webpack + React 16 + MUI\nto modern Vite + React 18 + Sass modules.\n\n## Changes\n\n### apps/login\n- Migrate from Webpack to Vite 6+ with @originjs/vite-plugin-federation\n- Upgrade React from 16.x to 18.3.1\n- Replace MUI components with @packages/ui and Sass modules\n- Convert key components from JS to TypeScript (.tsx)\n- Rename .js files with JSX to .jsx\n- Add polyfills for crypto and global (amazon-cognito-identity-js)\n- Add Vite plugins to fix legacy library issues:\n  - fixAuthManagerPlugin: Fix const reassignment in AuthManager.js\n  - fixGlobalThisPlugin: Fix ''var _global = this'' for ES modules\n  - copyI18nPlugin: Copy i18n files during build\n- Configure Vitest for testing (replacing Jest)\n- Add TypeScript configuration\n\n### apps/shell\n- Add plugins for login integration in development mode\n- Disable Module Federation conditionally in development\n- Add polyfills in index.html for remote modules\n- Load login via path alias in development\n\n### packages/ui\n- Remove auto-mount code that interfered with shell rendering\n\n### Root\n- Add CHANGELOG.md to document changes\n- Fix apps/login submodule reference (was corrupted)\n\n## Technical Notes\n- Login loads via path alias in dev, Module Federation in prod\n- Translations (i18n) need additional configuration for shell context\n- CORS issues expected in local development","tree":{"sha":"39c11ace2dd538e66c705261cf57609c32439d63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amallen22/module-federation-hybrid/git/trees/39c11ace2dd538e66c705261cf57609c32439d63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amallen22/module-federation-hybrid/git/commits/676fda6181f0d0bda615f0a51786396af3820dce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified