ace Documentation**\n  - Add detailed content for GAIA-QAO Aerospace Documentation\n\n* **Aerospace General Index (AGI) – Master Index**\n  - Add table of contents for AGI Master Index\n\n* **Aircraft Technical Description Manual: AMPEL360 BWB-Q100**\n  - Add detailed content for AMPEL360 BWB-Q100 Technical Description Manual","tree":{"sha":"52f70e5cb204e319c0085bae7f39eee83d8ea1e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmedeoPelliccia/GAIA-QA-Ontogenesis/git/trees/52f70e5cb204e319c0085bae7f39eee83d8ea1e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmedeoPelliccia/GAIA-QA-Ontogenesis/git/commits/19b09ef6ec2a500993373fffc71ae44c7e8a7799","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164860269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AmedeoPelliccia","id":164860269,"login":"AmedeoPelliccia","node_id":"U_kgDOCdORbQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AmedeoPelliccia/GAIA-QA-Ontogenesis/commit/19b09ef6ec2a500993373fffc71ae44c7e8a7799","node_id":"C_kwDOOyK8idoAKDE5YjA5ZWY2ZWMyYTUwMDk5MzM3M2ZmZmM3MWFlNDRjN2U4YTc3OTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AmedeoPelliccia/GAIA-QA-Ontogenesis/commit/6546ad2b49e46f29ccd5b77582b979945d6a52c0","sha":"6546ad2b49e46f29ccd5b77582b979945d6a52c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmedeoPelliccia/GAIA-QA-Ontogenesis/commits/6546ad2b49e46f29ccd5b77582b979945d6a52c0"}],"sha":"19b09ef6ec2a500993373fffc71ae44c7e8a7799","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmedeoPelliccia/GAIA-QA-Ontogenesis/commits/19b09ef6ec2a500993373fffc71ae44c7e8a7799"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164860269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AmedeoPelliccia","id":164860269,"login":"AmedeoPelliccia","node_id":"U_kgDOCdORbQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmedeoPelliccia/GAIA-QA-Ontogenesis/commits/6546ad2b49e46f29ccd5b77582b979945d6a52c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-28T17:06:00Z","email":"amedeo.pelliccia@gmail.com","name":"amedeo pelliccia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-28T17:06:00Z","email":"amedeo.pelliccia@gmail.com","name":"amedeo pelliccia"},"message":"This repository contains the GAIA-QA Ontogenesis project, which outlines the foundational principles and technical documentation for the GAIA-QAO federated system. The README file includes detailed sections on the project''s vision, architecture, key features, installation and setup, security and encryption, agent integration, performance metrics, development roadmap, and contributing guidelines.\n\n* The \"What It Is\" section describes the declarative cosmology for the GAIA-QAO system.\n* The \"Why It Matters\" section explains the importance of the project with a table of elements and descriptions.\n* The \"Implications for Agent Design\" section outlines the requirements for GAIA agents.\n* The \"Activation Metadata\" section provides YAML metadata for the project.\n* The \"Signature\" section includes a quote and author signature.\n* The \"GAIA Innovation Management Platform – README\" section details the platform''s vision, architecture, key features, and more.\n* The \"Document Metadata\" section provides YAML metadata for the technical documentation.\n* The \"GAIA-QAO Industry 5.0 Assurance Principle\" section outlines the core principles and implementation foundations for the assurance principle.\n* The \"Quantum Aerospace Organization Structure\" section lists the modules of the GAIA-QAO organization.\n* The \"Quick Access Links\" section provides links to GAIA-QAO modules.\n* The \"Project Status & Metadata\" section includes badges and metadata.\n* The \"GAIA-QAO Aerospace Documentation\" section provides a detailed overview of the documentation framework.\n* The \"Aerospace General Index (AGI) – Master Index\" section includes a table of contents for the AGI.\n* The \"Aircraft Technical Description Manual: AMPEL360 BWB-Q100\" section provides detailed content for the technical description manual.","tree":{"sha":"4fd9bbb204c9f9faff755badb7a7708089ff47ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmedeoPelliccia/GAIA-QA-Ontogenesis/git/trees/4fd9bbb204c9f9faff755badb7a7708089ff47ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmedeoPelliccia/GAIA-QA-Ontogenesis/git/commits/6546ad2b49e46f29ccd5b77582b979945d6a52c0",